  "$comment": [
    "Which upstream endpoint each catalogue variant is actually sent to.",
    "",
    "SERVER ONLY. Nothing under src/ or app/ may import this file, and ESLint",
    "refuses the import so the rule is enforced rather than remembered. These",
    "strings used to live on `Variant` in models.ts, which the browser bundles",
    "for FAMILIES -- so `model:\"bytedance/seedance-2-fast\"` shipped to every",
    "visitor and named our supplier in plain text in a JS chunk.",
    "",
    "Nothing in the browser ever read them: a customer picks a variant by our",
    "own id, and the price and the job both key off that. Only the seeders need",
    "the mapping, and seeders run on our machines.",
    "",
    "`modelWithRefs` is the separate entry point some models have for the",
    "image-to-X case; same price either way, so it selects an endpoint and",
    "nothing else."
